{title: I Know What Prayer Can Do}
{key: F}
{x_theme: healing, prayer}
{x_source: chrd:i_know_what_prayer_can_do.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
I know what [F]prayer can do
I know what [C]prayer can do
I [F]know what prayer can do
I [Bb]know what prayer can do
I [F]found the answer in prayer
[C]I'll tell it everywhere
And I [F]know, I [Bb]know, I [F/Bb]know what [F/C]prayer can [F]do

{comment: Chorus}
[Bb]Prayer, prayer, prayer changes things.
[F]Prayer, prayer, prayer changes things.
[Dm]I've been out,
Out on the stormy seas,
Until Jesus [C]came along,
And rescued me.
I've been [F]hungry, I've been sick,
I've been filled with misery;
Until Jesus [Bb]came along
And He [C]rescued me.
I [F]found the answer in prayer
[C]I'll tell it everywhere
And I [F]know, I [Bb]know, I [F/Bb]know what [F/C]prayer can [F]do

{comment: Verse 2}
It can heal [F]the sick
Even raise [C]the dead
I [F]remember the time
Five [Bb]thousand souls were fed
I [F]found the answer in prayer
[C]I'll tell it everywhere
And I [F]know, I [Bb]know, I [F/Bb]know what [F/C]prayer can [F]do

{comment: Verse 3}
I know He'll [F]see me through
I know He'll [C]see me through
I know He'll [F]see me through
I know He'll [Bb]see me through
I [F]found the answer in prayer
[C]I'll tell it everywhere
And I [F]know, I [Bb]know, I [F/Bb]know what [F/C]prayer can [F]do
